  "description": "The Tracer Siena 26” Chopper Stretch Cruiser Fat Tire Bike combines retro chopper style with modern comfort. Featuring a sturdy Hi-ten steel frame, fat 26”x3.0” tires, and a choice between 1-speed or 7-speed options, this bike is built for smooth, stylish cruising. The classic spring fork and spring-loaded saddle ensure a comfortable ride, while the alloy mechanical disc brake (7-speed version) and coaster brake (1-speed) provide reliable stopping power. Available in multiple colors, this bike is perfect for both city streets and relaxed weekend rides.\n\nCOLORS\nBlack, Blue, Green, Matte Black/Polished, Matte Black/Matte Black, Red, Gray\n\nSADDLE\nVacuum elastic PVC leather high density PU foam with springs\n\nSHIFTERS\n\n1 Speed: N/A\n7 Speed: Shimano SL-RS35-R, 7-speed\n\nREAR DERAILLEUR\n\n1 Speed: N/A\n7 Speed: Shimano Tourney TY300\n\nBRAKE\n\n1 Speed: Coaster\n7 Speed: Mechanical disc, 160mm rotor\n\nBOTTOM BRACKET\nBMX Cranks set Bottom Bracket Cr-Mo axle.\n\nRIMS\nAlloy FAT Front 3' Rear 4\" 26” *36H*14G Spoke wheelset.\n\nWEIGHT\nThe most accurate way to determine any bike’s weight is to have your local dealer weigh it for you. Many brands strive to list the lowest possible weight, but in reality, weight can vary based on size, finish, hardware and accessories. All our bikes are designed for best-in-class weight and ride quality.",
